# Second brain ({{ brain_root }})

Obsidian-compatible **markdown vault**. This directory is the plain-file truth
for the lab second brain (roadmap "cortex"). Software on top is replaceable.

## Primary UI: AI Workstation

The sibling app **[ai-workstation](https://github.com/moderndegree/ai-workstation)**
is the command center for this vault:

| Surface | What |
|---------|------|
| `/brain` | 3D knowledge graph, note pages, wiki-links, backlinks |
| Quick capture | Writes to `inbox/` |
| Cortex MCP | Agents search/read/capture via `pnpm mcp` + `CORTEX_VAULT_DIR` |

On ser5 (or any host with the vault mounted):

```bash
# .env.local in ai-workstation
CORTEX_VAULT_DIR={{ brain_root }}

# MCP for OpenCode / Hermes / Claude Desktop
CORTEX_VAULT_DIR={{ brain_root }} pnpm --dir /path/to/ai-workstation mcp
```

Empty local vaults can use the app's **seed** (lab MOCs from the roadmap).
This provisioned vault is never overwritten by the app seed.

## Optional: Obsidian

**Open folder as vault** → this directory. Templates folder = `templates/`.
Use when you want offline graph/edit without running Next.js.

## Layout (matches ai-workstation cortex kinds)

| Path | Kind | Purpose |
|------|------|---------|
| `inbox/` | inbox | Raw capture; triage later |
| `notes/` | note | Atomic notes (incl. `postmortems/`, `decisions/`) |
| `mocs/` | moc | Maps of content |
| `journal/` | journal | Daily notes |
| `sources/` | source | Archived clips |
| `playbooks/` | playbook | ACE tactics (`qloop` / agentlab; often a symlink) |
| `templates/` | (meta) | Copy-from postmortem/decision skeletons |

Dotdirs (`.obsidian`, `.cortex`, `.stfolder`) are ignored by the app index.

## Learn from mistakes

1. Copy `templates/postmortem.md` → `notes/postmortems/YYYY-MM-DD-title.md`
2. Fill symptom → bad question → TASK PACKAGE gaps → fixes
3. Promote durable rules into `playbooks/*.md` or `qloop playbook reflect`
4. Browse/link in **ai-workstation** `/brain` or Obsidian

## Governance

- Personal/lab vault by default — client material needs isolation (roadmap Phase 4)
- LLMs draft; files decide — review before treating notes as ground truth
- restic backs up `{{ brain_root }}` when `enable_backups` is on

